Detection corpus and score baseline
-----------------------------------

The test corpus under `internal/detector/testdata/corpus/` and the per-category
floor in `internal/detector/testdata/score-baseline.json` are derived from the
Agent Veil project (https://github.com/vurakit/agentveil), which is licensed
under the MIT License. They are reused here as an executable specification for
the detection engine: the engine in this repository is an independent
implementation, and the corpus is what holds it to the same behaviour.

